OL,3,GNEWSA'Doting grandad' named as victim
OL,4,Aof fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died in a car crash while
OL,7,Fdriving his wife to work has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as an "exceptionally proud
OL,9,Fand doting grandad".
OL,11,FPaul Hart, 57, from Shafton, near
OL,12,FBarnsley, was fatally injured when the
OL,13,Fwhite Ford EcoSport he was driving
OL,14,Fcollided with a blue Volkswagen Polo on
OL,15,Fthe A628 Hemsworth bypass at about
OL,16,F06:00 GMT on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
