OL,3,GNEWSA'Doting grandad' named as victim
OL,4,Aof fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis wife, 60, was taken to hospital
OL,7,Fwith non life-threatening injuries,
OL,8,FWest Yorkshire Police said. A
OL,9,F20-year-old man arrested on suspicion
OL,10,Fof causing death by dangerous driving
OL,11,Fremains on police bail.
OL,13,FIn a statement, Paul's family said:
OL,14,F"His sudden loss is devastating to all
OL,15,Fwho had the privilege of knowing him."
